{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q205145","formula":"C₃₅H₃₅NO₁₂","hill":"C35H35NO12","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":35.0,"H":35.0,"N":1.0,"O":12.0},"names":{"en":"Neocarzinostatin"},"descriptions":{"en":"Neocarzinostatin (NCS) is a macromolecular chromoprotein enediyne antitumor antibiotic secreted by Streptomyces macromomyceticus. It consists of two parts, a labile chromophore (the non-protein molecular entity shown at right) and a 113 amino acid protein to which the chromophore is tightly and non-covalently bound with high affinity (Kd ~ 10−10 M). The non-protein component is a very potent DNA-damaging agent; However it is extremely unstable and the role of the protein is to protect it and release it to the target DNA."},"fame":10,"pubchemCid":57125363,"mass":661.6,"charge":0,"smiles":"C[C@@H]1[C@@H]([C@@H]([C@H]([C@H](O1)O[C@H]2[C@@H](C=C3C2CC#CC4[C@@](O4)(C#C3)C5COC(=O)O5)OC(=O)C6=C(C=CC7=C6C=C(C=C7C)OC)O)NC)O)O","inchikey":"BLXZMHNVKCEIJX-LTZUVELHSA-N","iupac":"[(4S,11R,12R)-11-[(2R,3R,4R,5R,6R)-4,5-dihydroxy-6-methyl-3-(methylamino)oxan-2-yl]oxy-4-(2-oxo-1,3-dioxolan-4-yl)-5-oxatricyclo[8.3.0.04,6]tridec-1(13)-en-2,7-diyn-12-yl] 2-hydroxy-7-methoxy-5-methylnaphthalene-1-carboxylate","classes":[{"qid":"Q59199015","names":{"en":"group of stereoisomers","ru":"группа стереоизомеров","uk":"група стереоізомерів"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"57125363","atoms":83,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-5.275,"y":-0.729,"z":-2.129,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.895,"y":-1.369,"z":-2.239,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.89,"y":-2.573,"z":-3.196,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.53,"y":-3.271,"z":-3.151,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.156,"y":-3.636,"z":-1.702,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.212,"y":-2.348,"z":-0.837,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.491,"y":-1.723,"z":-0.905,"el":"O"},{"x":-1.18,"y":-1.45,"z":-1.257,"el":"O"},{"x":-0.689,"y":-0.597,"z":-0.211,"el":"C"},{"x":0.653,"y":0.014,"z":-0.699,"el":"C"},{"x":0.48,"y":1.486,"z":-0